The gate AIR and LogUp generation adapt patterns from crates/examples/src/plonk/mod.rs.
Hallmark adds pinned wiring/fanout, public-boundary contributions, independently enrolled preprocessing, an explicit product column and unbatched quadratic LogUp, strict field/proof admission and a separate verifier binary.
The upstream engine is a locked registry dependency, not vendored here.
